+`quota_reservations`, `usage_counters`, `apierr.QuotaExceeded`, stable
+`yalla.output.v1` / `yalla.error.v1` envelopes with request IDs,
+concurrency tests, tenant-isolation tests, fake-Dokploy-by-default behavior,
